  "title": "Passenger seriously ill in cruise; medical diversion",
  "narrative": "Over the Bay of Biscay approach, 09:10Z. On Accent Air ACX123 from Manchester to Faro, an A321 (AX-MED) with 204 passengers, a passenger collapses and does not respond well to first aid. A doctor on board advises landing as soon as possible; the commander diverts to Nantes. An ambulance must meet the aircraft, the passenger's companion and bags must come off, and the flight should continue to Faro if the crew's duty time allows. The commander flies and decides the aircraft; the agents prepare the ground.",
